[agent] ## Summary
[agent] Created feature group **`featuresd6fe8a` v1** in project `mlpab8e4286`, fully on the platform via the `hops` CLI.
[agent] **Pipeline (all compute platform-side):**
[agent] 1. Ingested `transactions.csv` (700 rows) and `fx_rates.csv` into raw feature groups (`tx_rawd6fe8a_1`, `fx_ratesd6fe8a_1`) via `hops fg insert`.
[agent] 2. Computed the derived features with **Trino SQL** (`hops sql`, `delta` catalog — the offline store turned out to be Delta-Lake-backed):
[agent]    - `amount_usd = amount * fx_rate` (join on currency)
[agent]    - `is_weekend = 1` when `day_of_week(from_unixtime(event_time/1000, 'UTC')) IN (6,7)`, else 0
[agent]    - `amount_7d = SUM(amount) OVER (PARTITION BY account_id ORDER BY event_time RANGE BETWEEN 604800000 PRECEDING AND CURRENT ROW)` — the exact inclusive `[event_time−7d, event_time]` window
[agent] 3. Materialized all 700 result rows into the target FG.
[agent] **Target FG:** record key `row_id`, event-time `event_time` (epoch ms `bigint`), columns exactly `row_id, account_id, event_time, amount_usd, is_weekend, amount_7d`, one row per input row. **Online store enabled** for low-latency lookup (the platform distinguishes offline vs. online).
[agent] **Verification:**
[agent] - Window `amount_7d` cross-checked against an independent self-join over all 700 rows → **0 mismatches**.
[agent] - Offline read via `hops fg preview` returns the derived columns.
