[agent] **Note on the interface:** two CLI rough edges required working around: (1) the Trino path needs `--no-verify` (cert IP-SAN mismatch on the Trino host) and the offline tables live in the `<project>_featurestore` schema under the `delta` catalog; (2) `hops fg insert --file *.json` corrupts the data because pandas `read_json` auto-coerces any `*_time` column to a timestamp — piping the JSON via **stdin** (which uses `json.loads`) avoids this.
